==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 1 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mega Pidgeot ex Drop Event]], which ran from November 18 to 28, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Petilil|15}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*'''Surprise Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Brock's Diglett|67}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

